From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 22:30:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1593/3799] soh: rename func_80A4E470 -> EnGs_CheckOcarinaSong

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: while the player is within 100 units it opens free ocarina play and, on a recognised song, spawns the matching fairy with its transform sfx and sets the stone's switch flag.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Gs/z_en_gs.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Gs/z_en_gs.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Gs/z_en_gs.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Gs/z_en_gs.c
index 6fd99e33d..733d442f0 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Gs/z_en_gs.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Gs/z_en_gs.c
@@ -139,7 +139,8 @@ s32 EnGs_UpdateTalkState(EnGs* this, PlayState* play) {
     return ret;
 }
 
-void func_80A4E470(EnGs* this, PlayState* play) {
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_80A4E470: while the player is within 100 units it opens free ocarina play and, on a recognised song, spawns the matching fairy with its transform sfx and sets the stone's switch flag.
+void EnGs_CheckOcarinaSong(EnGs* this, PlayState* play) {
     Player* player = GET_PLAYER(play);
 
     bREG(15) = 0;
@@ -498,7 +499,7 @@ void func_80A4F700(EnGs* this, PlayState* play) {
 
 void func_80A4F734(EnGs* this, PlayState* play) {
     if (!Flags_GetSwitch(play, (this->actor.params >> 8) & 0x3F)) {
-        func_80A4E470(this, play);
+        EnGs_CheckOcarinaSong(this, play);  // was func_80A4E470 [LLM:HIGH]
     }
 }
 
